        <p>Downtown Valencia preserves historic buildings and 30s-60s homes with inner courtyards, high ceilings and load-bearing walls. There are also apartment buildings from the 70s-80s. Homes in the historic center have load-bearing walls, obsolete electrical systems and moisture problems from poor ventilation. Any structural work requires reinforcement and respect for heritage.</p>
